<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Home-screen "Frequency Cassette" widget (renamed 2026-09-10, direct user request — was
     "Soundtrack") — plays the app's own ambient "Log Screen" music tracks (the same 4
     choices as Profile > Display > Sound > Ambient Music: 1.0/2.0/3.0 Login Screen +
     Convene) via SoundtrackPlaybackService, a genuine foreground MediaPlayer service so
     playback survives the widget/app not being on screen.

     Restyled a second time the same day: the user supplied an actual product photo
     (Cassette_Widget.png, alpha-cutout around the device's own irregular silhouette —
     bundled as a Capacitor web asset at public/widgets/cassette-widget.png, decoded/scaled
     by SoundtrackWidget.java the same way the old "Log 2.0" background art was) and asked
     for the widget to look like THAT specific device, not the shape-drawable
     reinterpretation from the first pass (that attempt's widget_cassette_background/
     widget_cassette_screen_bg/ic_cassette_reel/ic_cassette_waveform/
     widget_cassette_button_bg/widget_cassette_play_bg are all deleted — the real photo
     supersedes every one of them, and layering the old hand-drawn reel/waveform/screen-panel
     decorations on TOP of a real photo that already has its own reel/screen/scrub-bar art
     would look cluttered, not additive).

     The root background is genuinely transparent now (@android:color/transparent) — the
     photo's own alpha cutout IS the widget's visible edge, matching the "uneven border" the
     user asked about (a rectangle can't do that; an alpha-cutout silhouette always could).

     Track name text and the 4 real transport buttons are positioned as FRACTIONS of the
     photo's own pixel layout (measured directly against the 1840×1050 source: the blank
     cream panel at x 700-1550/y 430-520 for text, the 4 physical button labels at
     x 596-1526/y 860-980 for controls), built from nested weighted LinearLayouts (RemoteViews
     has no percentage-margin attribute, so weight-sum spacers are the standard substitute).
     This holds up under resize ONLY because the background ImageView uses scaleType="fitXY"
     (stretches non-uniformly to exactly fill the widget) rather than fitCenter/centerCrop —
     both axes scale by the exact same widget-width/height factors the fractional weights are
     already expressed in, so the overlay tracks the photo's real button positions at any
     size. A uniform-scale mode would NOT compose with this: it'd letterbox and drift the
     overlay off the real buttons as soon as the widget's cell aspect ratio differs from the
     photo's own 1840:1050.

     Only 4 real button positions exist in the photo, but the kit has 5 transport actions
     (shuffle/prev/play/next/loop) — mapped prev/play/next onto the 3 middle real buttons
     (the ones a "transport row" reads as), the left real button onto loop (closest visual
     fit — Off-Tune... no, just the nearest slot), and shuffle onto the round dial in the
     photo's top-right corner (visually already knob-shaped, a reasonable second control
     zone) rather than dropping it. This mapping is a judgment call, not a measured fact the
     way the button/text positions above are — flagged here for anyone tuning it further.

     TWO alternate content blocks, not one — widget_soundtrack_content_normal (the
     photo-mapped layout above) reads fine down to 2 cells tall, but doesn't fit in a
     1-cell-tall placement at all (the photo would be squeezed into an unrecognizable
     sliver); widget_soundtrack_content_compact falls back to a plain flat row — text +
     small icon buttons, no photo-position mapping attempted — which SoundtrackWidget.java
     switches to below its own height threshold, same compact-mode pattern
     PulseBannerWidget.java already uses for its own short placements. Both blocks' data/
     PendingIntents are applied identically every render; only whichever one is actually
     visible matters.

     No plain <View> anywhere (RemoteViews' allowlist doesn't include it) — spacer/positioner
     layers use empty FrameLayouts instead. -->
<FrameLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="@android:color/transparent">

    <ImageView
        android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_bg_art"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:scaleType="fitXY"
        android:contentDescription="@null" />

    <!-- ═══ Normal (>= 2 cells tall): photo-position-mapped overlay ═══ -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_content_normal"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:orientation="vertical">

        <!-- Row 1/3 (vertical weights 41/9/50 ≈ the photo's y 430-520 of 1050) — track name,
             centered in the cream panel right of the tape reels. Tap to cycle to the next
             track, same interaction as the Calculator widget's own copy-target pill. -->
        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="41" />
        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="9"
            android:orientation="horizontal">
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="38" />
            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_track_name"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="46"
                android:gravity="center">
                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_track_name_text"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:textColor="#3D2817"
                    android:textSize="14sp"
                    android:textStyle="bold"
                    android:maxLines="1"
                    android:ellipsize="end" />
            </LinearLayout>
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="16" />
        </LinearLayout>
        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="50" />

        <!-- Row 2/3 (vertical weights 82/11/7 ≈ the photo's y 860-980 of 1050) — the 4 real
             physical button labels, horizontal weights 32/11/12/14/13/18 ≈ their real x
             596/794/1022/1286/1526 of 1840. -->
        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="82" />
        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="11"
            android:orientation="horizontal">
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="32" />
            <!-- Loop toggle on the leftmost real button (nearest available slot — see file
                 header). Selected-state overlay: RemoteViews can't runtime-swap a view's own
                 background, so the "on" highlight is a second view toggled by visibility. -->
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="11">
                <FrameLayout
                    android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_loop_selected"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="match_parent"
                    android:background="@drawable/widget_target_selected_emerald"
                    android:visibility="gone" />
                <ImageButton
                    android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_loop"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="match_parent"
                    android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                    android:src="@drawable/ic_loop_widget"
                    android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                    android:padding="6dp"
                    android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_loop_aria" />
            </FrameLayout>
            <ImageButton
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_prev"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="12"
                android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_previous"
                android:tint="#3D2817"
                android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                android:padding="4dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_prev_aria" />
            <ImageButton
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_play"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="14"
                android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_play"
                android:tint="#3D2817"
                android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                android:padding="4dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_play_aria" />
            <ImageButton
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_next"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="13"
                android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_next"
                android:tint="#3D2817"
                android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                android:padding="4dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_next_aria" />
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="18" />
        </LinearLayout>
        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="7" />
    </LinearLayout>

    <!-- Shuffle toggle on the photo's own round dial, top-right corner (horizontal weights
         90/8/2 ≈ x 1650-1790 of 1840; vertical weights 9/23/68 ≈ y 90-330 of 1050) — see file
         header for why shuffle didn't fit into the 4-button row. A SIBLING of
         widget_soundtrack_content_normal (not nested inside it) only because it needed its
         own independent weighted-positioner tree rooted at the full widget height rather than
         the transport row's — SoundtrackWidget.java toggles this id's visibility in lockstep
         with content_normal/content_compact so it doesn't float over the compact layout too. -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_dial_wrap"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:orientation="vertical">
        <FrameLayout android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="0dp" android:layout_weight="9" />
        <LinearLayout
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="23"
            android:orientation="horizontal">
            <FrameLayout android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="match_parent" android:layout_weight="90" />
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="8">
                <FrameLayout
                    android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_selected"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="match_parent"
                    android:background="@drawable/widget_target_selected_emerald"
                    android:visibility="gone" />
                <ImageButton
                    android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_shuffle"
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="match_parent"
                    android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                    android:src="@drawable/ic_shuffle_widget"
                    android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                    android:padding="4dp"
                    android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_aria" />
            </FrameLayout>
            <FrameLayout android:layout_width="0dp" android:layout_height="match_parent" android:layout_weight="2" />
        </LinearLayout>
        <FrameLayout android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="0dp" android:layout_weight="68" />
    </LinearLayout>

    <!-- ═══ Compact (1 cell tall): plain flat row, no photo-position mapping (too short for
         the photo to read as anything but a texture) ═══ -->
    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_content_compact"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:orientation="horizontal"
        android:gravity="center_vertical"
        android:paddingLeft="8dp"
        android:paddingRight="8dp"
        android:visibility="gone">

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_track_name_compact_text"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_weight="1"
            android:layout_marginRight="6dp"
            android:textColor="#3D2817"
            android:textSize="16sp"
            android:textStyle="bold"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:ellipsize="end" />

        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="24dp"
            android:layout_height="24dp">
            <FrameLayout
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_selected_compact"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:background="@drawable/widget_target_selected_emerald"
                android:visibility="gone" />
            <ImageButton
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_compact"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                android:src="@drawable/ic_shuffle_widget"
                android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                android:padding="2dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_shuffle_aria" />
        </FrameLayout>

        <ImageButton
            android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_prev_compact"
            android:layout_width="24dp"
            android:layout_height="24dp"
            android:layout_marginLeft="6dp"
            android:background="@android:color/transparent"
            android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_previous"
            android:tint="#3D2817"
            android:scaleType="fitCenter"
            android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_prev_aria" />

        <ImageButton
            android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_play_compact"
            android:layout_width="32dp"
            android:layout_height="32dp"
            android:layout_marginLeft="6dp"
            android:background="@android:color/transparent"
            android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_play"
            android:tint="#3D2817"
            android:scaleType="fitCenter"
            android:padding="4dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_play_aria" />

        <ImageButton
            android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_next_compact"
            android:layout_width="24dp"
            android:layout_height="24dp"
            android:layout_marginLeft="6dp"
            android:background="@android:color/transparent"
            android:src="@android:drawable/ic_media_next"
            android:tint="#3D2817"
            android:scaleType="fitCenter"
            android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_next_aria" />

        <FrameLayout
            android:layout_width="24dp"
            android:layout_height="24dp"
            android:layout_marginLeft="6dp">
            <FrameLayout
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_loop_selected_compact"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:background="@drawable/widget_target_selected_emerald"
                android:visibility="gone" />
            <ImageButton
                android:id="@+id/widget_soundtrack_loop_compact"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:background="@android:color/transparent"
                android:src="@drawable/ic_loop_widget"
                android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                android:padding="2dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/widget_soundtrack_loop_aria" />
        </FrameLayout>
    </LinearLayout>
</FrameLayout>
